  1192→- 6 situational — hypothetical scenarios relevant to the role
  1193→- 3 competency-based — core competencies for this specific role
  1194→- 2 role-specific — unique questions that only apply to this exact position
  1195→
  1196→For each question, vary difficulty: roughly 30% easy, 50% medium, 20% hard.
  1197→
  1198→Return a JSON array where each item has:
  1199→{
  1200→  "question_text": "The interview question",
